---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { BASE } from '../config';
const extras = [
  {
    icon: 'chart',
    title: '成绩试算',
    desc: '下一个目标，提前算一算',
    anchor: 'academics',
  },
  {
    icon: 'branch',
    title: '毕业学分进度',
    desc: '走了多远，还差多少',
    anchor: 'academics',
  },
  {
    icon: 'alert',
    title: '考试冲突检查',
    desc: '撞期的安排，早点知道',
    anchor: 'schedule',
  },
  {
    icon: 'widget',
    title: 'Android 小组件',
    desc: '不用打开应用，也能看课表',
    anchor: 'experience',
  },
];
---

<section
  class="section features-section"
  id="features"
  aria-labelledby="features-title"
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="home-section-heading reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="section-index">01 / 你的校园工具箱</p><h2 id="features-title">
          琐事归位，<br class="mobile-break" />生活就有了余地。
        </h2>
      </div><p>不必记住所有事。<br />有些事，让理枝替你记着。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card schedule-card reveal">
        <div class="card-heading">
          <span class="feature-icon"><Icon name="calendar" size={21} /></span
          ><span class="feature-number">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3>下一节课，不用再翻群聊。</h3><p>
          同步学校课表，按周查看课程与教室。<br
          />当前进度、上课地点，一眼就清楚。
        </p>
        <div class="schedule-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="day-label">星期四 <span>THURSDAY</span><b>22</b></div><div
            class="lesson"
          >
            <span class="lesson-time">08:00<span>09:35</span></span><div
              class="lesson-content"
            >
              <b>大学物理</b><span>南区理科楼 D-201</span>
            </div><span class="lesson-status">已结束</span>
          </div><div class="lesson is-current">
            <span class="lesson-time">09:55<span>11:30</span></span><div
              class="lesson-content"
            >
              <b>数据结构</b><span>文萃 F-210</span>
            </div><span class="lesson-status"><i></i>正在上课</span>
          </div><div class="lesson-next">
            <span></span> 下午没有课，安排一点自己的时间。<Icon
              name="leaf"
              size={15}
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="card-link" href={`${BASE}features/#g-schedule`}
          >认识课程表 <Icon name="arrow-right" size={16} /></a
        >
      </article>
      <article
        class="feature-card agenda-card reveal"
        style="--reveal-delay: 80ms"
      >
        <div class="card-heading">
          <span class="feature-icon"><Icon name="clock" size={21} /></span><span
            class="feature-number">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3>DDL 再多，也不乱了阵脚。</h3><p>
          乐学、新延河课堂的待办同步到一处，<br />考试和活动，也能一起安排。
        </p>
        <div class="agenda-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="agenda-date">
            <span>待办清单</span><span
              >按截止时间排列 <Icon name="chevron-down" size={11} /></span>
          </div><div class="agenda-task">
            <span class="task-check"></span><div>
              <b>数据结构实验报告</b><span
                ><i class="source-tag">乐学</i> 今天 23:59</span>
            </div><span class="task-due">今天</span>
          </div><div class="agenda-task">
            <span class="task-check"></span><div>
              <b>大学英语 · 单元作业</b><span
                ><i class="source-tag teal">新延河课堂</i> 明天 18:00</span>
            </div>
          </div><div class="agenda-task completed">
            <span class="task-check"><Icon name="check" size={11} /></span><div>
              <b>物理实验预习</b><span>已完成，做得不错。</span>
            </div><Icon name="leaf" size={15} />
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="card-link" href={`${BASE}features/#g-schedule`}
          >了解日程管理 <Icon name="arrow-right" size={16} /></a
        >
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card grades-card reveal">
        <div class="card-heading">
          <span class="feature-icon"><Icon name="chart" size={21} /></span><span
            class="feature-number">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3>每一份努力，都有迹可循。</h3><p>
          同步各学期成绩，按学校规则计算绩点。<br
          />学分进度与下一步的目标，心里都有数。
        </p>
        <div class="grades-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="gpa-stat">
            <span>加权平均绩点</span><strong>3.82<small>/ 4.0</small></strong
            ><span class="gpa-caption">一步一步，继续生长。</span>
          </div><div class="grade-bars">
            <div style="--bar:48%"><i></i><span>大一上</span></div><div
              style="--bar:65%"
            >
              <i></i><span>大一下</span>
            </div><div style="--bar:76%"><i></i><span>大二上</span></div><div
              class="bar-current"
              style="--bar:90%"
            >
              <i></i><span>大二下</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="card-link" href={`${BASE}features/#g-academics`}
          >看看学业管理 <Icon name="arrow-right" size={16} /></a
        >
      </article>
      <article
        class="feature-card classroom-card reveal"
        style="--reveal-delay: 80ms"
      >
        <div class="card-heading">
          <span class="feature-icon"><Icon name="door" size={21} /></span><span
            class="feature-number">04</span>
        </div>
        <h3>找个安静角落，坐下来。</h3><p>
          按校区、教学楼与时段查询空教室，<br />不用一间间找，自习前就选好位置。
        </p>
        <div class="room-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="room-filters">
            <span>良乡校区 <Icon name="chevron-down" size={11} /></span><span
              >文萃楼 <Icon name="chevron-down" size={11} /></span
            ><span class="available-filter"><i></i> 仅看空闲</span>
          </div><div class="room-table">
            <div class="room-table-head">
              <span>教室</span><span>13:20</span><span>15:15</span><span
                >18:30</span>
            </div>{
              ['F-210', 'F-305', 'F-402'].map((room, index) => (
                <div class="room-row">
                  <>
                    <b>{room}</b>
                    <span class="room-free">空闲</span>
                    <span
                      class:list={{
                        'room-free': index !== 1,
                        'room-busy': index === 1,
                      }}
                    >
                      {index === 1 ? '有课' : '空闲'}
                    </span>
                    <span
                      class:list={{
                        'room-free': index !== 2,
                        'room-busy': index === 2,
                      }}
                    >
                      {index === 2 ? '有课' : '空闲'}
                    </span>
                  </>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="card-link" href={`${BASE}features/#g-schedule`}
          >了解空教室查询 <Icon name="arrow-right" size={16} /></a
        >
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="visual-note">
      以上为功能示意，课程、成绩及教室信息均为示例数据。
    </p>
    <div class="extra-features reveal">
      {
        extras.map((item) => (
          <a href={`${BASE}features/#g-${item.anchor}`}>
            <>
              <Icon name={item.icon} size={21} />
              <div>
                <>
                  <h3>{item.title}</h3>
                  <p>{item.desc}</p>
                </>
              </div>
              <span>
                <Icon name="arrow-right" size={14} />
              </span>
            </>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    padding: 30px 32px 23px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition:
      border-color 0.25s var(--ease),
      transform 0.25s var(--ease);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-line);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .schedule-card {
    grid-column: span 7;
    background: var(--home-green-card);
  }
  .agenda-card {
    grid-column: span 5;
    background: var(--home-sand-card);
  }
  .grades-card {
    grid-column: span 5;
  }
  .classroom-card {
    grid-column: span 7;
    background: var(--home-blue-card);
  }
  .card-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 23px;
  }
  .feature-icon {
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .feature-number {
    font: 11px var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 25px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .feature-card > p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .card-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .card-link:hover {
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .card-link :global(svg) {
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .card-link:hover :global(svg) {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  .schedule-visual,
  .agenda-visual,
  .room-visual {
    margin-top: 28px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 17px 19px;
  }
  .day-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .day-label > span {
    font: 7px var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .day-label > b {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--brand);
    font: 16px var(--font-mono);
  }
  .lesson {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 13px 0;
  }
  .lesson-time {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    font: 9px var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .lesson-time > span {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 8px;
  }
  .lesson-content {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--home-blue-line);
    padding-left: 13px;
  }
  .lesson-content b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 550;
  }
  .lesson-content > span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 8px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .lesson-status {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 8px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .is-current {
    margin: 0 -9px;
    padding: 12px 9px;
    background: var(--brand-soft);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .is-current .lesson-content {
    border-color: var(--brand);
  }
  .is-current .lesson-status {
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .lesson-status i {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .lesson-next {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 8px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    padding-top: 14px;
  }
  .lesson-next > span {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--line-2);
  }
  .lesson-next :global(svg) {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .agenda-date {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .agenda-date > span:last-child {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 7px;
  }
  .agenda-task {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-top: 19px;
  }
  .task-check {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .agenda-task b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .agenda-task div > span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 7px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .source-tag {
    background: var(--home-tag-sand);
    color: var(--amber);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 6px;
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .source-tag.teal {
    color: var(--brand);
    background: var(--brand-soft);
  }
  .task-due {
    margin-left: auto;
    background: var(--home-tag-sand);
    color: var(--home-orange);
    font-size: 7px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .completed {
    padding-top: 12px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
  }
  .completed .task-check {
    background: var(--brand-soft);
    color: var(--brand);
    border-color: var(--brand-line);
  }
  .completed b {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .completed > :global(svg) {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .grades-visual {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 25px;
    padding: 25px 0 20px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    min-height: 189px;
  }
  .gpa-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .gpa-stat > span {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .gpa-stat strong {
    font: 500 44px/1.5 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--brand);
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .gpa-stat small {
    font: 10px var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-left: 5px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .gpa-stat > .gpa-caption {
    font-size: 8px;
  }
  .grade-bars {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex: 1;
    height: 115px;
  }
  .grade-bars > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: end;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 100%;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .grade-bars i {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 32px;
    height: var(--bar);
    border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
    background: var(--brand-soft);
  }
  .grade-bars .bar-current i {
    background: var(--home-bar);
  }
  .grade-bars span {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .room-visual {
    padding-block: 14px;
  }
  .room-filters {
    display: flex;
    gap: 9px;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .room-filters > span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 3px 7px;
    font-size: 8px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .room-filters .available-filter {
    border: none;
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--brand);
    font-size: 7px;
    padding-inline: 0;
  }
  .available-filter i {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--brand);
  }
  .room-table-head,
  .room-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .room-table-head {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font: 7px var(--font-mono);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .room-table-head > span:first-child {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .room-row {
    padding-block: 6px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .room-row b {
    text-align: left;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font: 9px var(--font-mono);
  }
  .room-row > span {
    font-size: 7px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 3px 0;
  }
  .room-free {
    color: var(--brand);
    background: var(--brand-soft);
  }
  .room-busy {
    color: var(--text-3);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .visual-note {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .extra-features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin-top: 34px;
  }
  .extra-features > a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .extra-features > a:first-child {
    padding-left: 0;
  }
  .extra-features > a:last-child {
    border: none;
    padding-right: 0;
  }
  .extra-features > a > :global(svg) {
    color: var(--brand);
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .extra-features h3 {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 550;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .extra-features p {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-top: 5px;
  }
  .extra-features a > span {
    margin-left: auto;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-5px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.2s,
      transform 0.2s;
  }
  .extra-features a:hover > span {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }
  .mobile-break {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    .feature-card {
      padding: 25px;
    }
    .schedule-card,
    .agenda-card,
    .grades-card,
    .classroom-card {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }
    .grades-visual {
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .gpa-stat strong {
      font-size: 37px;
    }
    .extra-features > a {
      padding-inline: 12px;
      gap: 9px;
    }
    .extra-features a > span {
      display: none;
    }
    .room-table-head,
    .room-row {
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .room-filters {
      gap: 5px;
    }
    .room-filters > span {
      gap: 3px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .home-section-heading {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .feature-grid {
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      padding: 24px;
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
    .card-heading {
      margin-bottom: 21px;
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 23px;
    }
    .feature-card > p {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .schedule-visual,
    .agenda-visual,
    .room-visual {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .grades-visual {
      min-height: 175px;
    }
    .grade-bars {
      max-width: 220px;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
    .gpa-stat strong {
      font-size: 46px;
    }
    .extra-features {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-top: 24px;
      gap: 20px 10px;
    }
    .extra-features > a {
      border: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .extra-features > a:nth-child(even) {
      padding-left: 14px;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .extra-features p {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .visual-note {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .mobile-break {
      display: block;
    }
    .lesson {
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 390px) {
    .feature-card {
      padding: 21px;
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 21px;
    }
    .schedule-visual,
    .agenda-visual,
    .room-visual {
      padding-inline: 12px;
    }
    .room-table-head,
    .room-row {
      gap: 7px;
    }
    .room-filters .available-filter {
      font-size: 6px;
    }
    .extra-features h3 {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .grades-visual {
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .gpa-stat strong {
      font-size: 34px;
    }
    .gpa-stat small {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .grade-bars {
      gap: 7px;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .grade-bars > div {
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .grade-bars span {
      font-size: 5px;
    }
  }
</style>
